      "url": "",
      "score": 51,
      "flags": 0,
      "comment_count": 39,
      "description": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>I recently saw a post about an NYC lobsters meetup, and am wondering how many people here could make it to a London meetup.</p>\n<p>If more than a couple of people here are based in London and can make it, I'll organise one in central London.</p>\n<p>If you could also let me know which day of the week works best for you, that would be great too!</p>\n<p>Cheers!</p>\n",
      "description_plain": "Hi everyone, \r\n\r\nI recently saw a post about an NYC lobsters meetup, and am wondering how many people here could make it to a London meetup. \r\n\r\nIf more than a couple of people here are based in London and can make it, I'll organise one in central London. \r\n\r\nIf you could also let me know which day of the week works best for you, that would be great too! \r\n\r\nCheers!",
